[
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "美式，热的。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "shot_id": 14,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "……这个月KPI又完不成了。老陈说再不签下来就让我走人。那家店……合同都准备好了……",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 1,
    "shot_id": 22,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "多少钱？",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 6,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "……前女友说我不懂感情。也许她说得对。但我也不懂为什么隔壁那家破咖啡店的咖啡比星巴克好喝……不对，我在想什么，我是来谈收购的……",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.9,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 9,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "想不起来什么时候划的",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 12,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "连看书都能受伤",
    "speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 14,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你好。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 16,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我叫顾深。对面写字楼的。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.9,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 18,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "不考虑。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 2,
    "shot_id": 20,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "好吧。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 3,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你记得我喝什么？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 3,
    "shot_id": 8,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "为什么你不出来追我？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "soft, trailing off, voice cracking",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 3,
    "shot_id": 14,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你还好吗？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 4.7,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 3,
    "shot_id": 16,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "没事。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "soft, trailing off, voice cracking",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "外婆的店……门口有这棵树？",
    "speaker": "grandmother",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.6,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 5,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你最近太累了。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 8,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "锐见投资。苏念，他是来收购的。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.6,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 10,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "这是你外婆。你还记得她冲咖啡的样子吗？",
    "speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 12,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "不太记得了。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 16,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "送给小念。希望你永远记得。",
    "speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 4,
    "shot_id": 20,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "小念，记住：拉花不是技术，是心意。",
    "speaker": "grandmother",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "苏老板，久仰。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.0,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 2,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "不卖。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.0,
    "shot_type": "ECU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你喝什么？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 4,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "豆子不错。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.5,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 9,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "……条件开得够高了。她不识货。但老陈说得对，这条街要改造，她的店迟早要拆。不如趁现在给她一个好价钱。不过……这咖啡确实好喝。比我十年前自己开的那家强。那时候……",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.0,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 14,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "——你考虑一下。我的名片——",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.0,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 15,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你也开过咖啡店。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.5,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 16,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "什么？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.5,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 5,
    "shot_id": 17,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你怎么知道的？",
    "speaker": "Chen Rui",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 2,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "美式。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.9,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你每天都来。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.9,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 4,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你的咖啡比楼下的好。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.6,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 5,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "等一下。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "whispered, restrained, breathing heavy",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "shot_type": "ECU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 6,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "因为这是外婆留给我的。",
    "speaker": "grandmother",
    "emotion": "sharp intake of breath, voice breaking",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 6,
    "shot_id": 13,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "看到过画面",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.2,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 7,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你从来不听我说话",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "soft, trailing off, voice cracking",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 7,
    "shot_id": 7,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "……他不知道我为什么生气。他永远不知道。我只是想让他记住我的生日，就一次……",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.7,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 7,
    "shot_id": 11,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "告诉他你为什么生气。不是因为那件事，是因为生日。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 5.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "给你。",
    "speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 7.0,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 2,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "这是……外婆？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 7.0,
    "shot_type": "ECU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 4,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "苏念，你认不出来了？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 6.3,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 6,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我记得她的名字。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 6.3,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 7,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你最近到底怎么了？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 7.0,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 8,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "苏念，你哥以前也——",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 6.3,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 9,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我哥怎么了？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "sharp intake of breath, voice breaking",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 8,
    "shot_id": 10,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "没什么。",
    "speaker": "Lin Ke",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你为什么每次都喝我喝过的咖啡？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "巧合。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 6,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "第一次，我以为你口渴。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "whispered, restrained, breathing heavy",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 8,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你喝完之后，",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "sharp intake of breath, voice breaking",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 11,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你多想了。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 12,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "也许。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.4,
    "shot_type": "ECU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 13,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我送你回去。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 15,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "苏念。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 17,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我明天还会来喝咖啡。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 18,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你不用——",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 19,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我不是来收购你的店的。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "whispered, restrained, breathing heavy",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 20,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你让我想起一个人。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 4.9,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 9,
    "shot_id": 21,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "但又完全不同。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "whispered, restrained, breathing heavy",
    "duration": 4.9,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 10,
    "shot_id": 2,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "第1天：读心灰色西装男（顾深）。失去——手背上一道印痕。原因不明。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 7.5,
    "shot_type": "ECU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 10,
    "shot_id": 4,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "想不起来了",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 10,
    "shot_id": 8,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "规律：读心次数越多，失去的记忆越重要。从无关紧要的印记，到重要的人。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 10,
    "shot_id": 11,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "明天我来喝咖啡。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 6.8,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 10,
    "shot_id": 12,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "别来了。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.8,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 1,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "苏老板，这是我们的评估团队。",
    "speaker": "Chen Rui",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "shot_type": "WS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 3,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "公司给了最后期限。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 4,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你这栋楼的产权——",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 9,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "……老陈说的违规是真的。但我也查过——那栋楼的产权问题其实在三年前就解决了，公司故意隐瞒了这个信息。他们就是要逼她低价卖。我不该告诉她。但——",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.5,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 13,
    "type": "inner_voice",
    "text_zh": "那时候也没人站在我这边。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.1,
    "shot_type": "MS"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 11,
    "shot_id": 22,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "陈总。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.9,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 12,
    "shot_id": 11,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "你今天没喝。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "sharp intake of breath, voice breaking",
    "duration": 4.3,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 12,
    "shot_id": 12,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "什么？",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "low, deliberate, pauses between words",
    "duration": 4.3,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 12,
    "shot_id": 17,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我不渴。",
    "speaker": "Su Nian",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 3.0,
    "shot_type": "MCU"
  },
  {
    "chapter": 12,
    "shot_id": 20,
    "type": "onscreen",
    "text_zh": "我查了一下。",
    "speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "emotion": "calm, conversational",
    "duration": 4.3,
    "shot_type": "CU"
  },
  {
